id=quest1_cast_feedback_shim
name=Quest 1 cast feedback shim
version=6
versionCode=6
author=Bubbagum88
description=Fixes slow/laggy casting to a Chromecast/TV that has two live network interfaces. A Zygisk shim normalizes the feedback source address so Horizon's WebRTC stops dropping it. Off by default: setprop debug.qe.cast_shim 1 to enable.
